# Banking Data Platform
![Java](https://img.shields.io/badge/Java-21-orange)
![Spring Boot](https://img.shields.io/badge/Spring%20Boot-3-brightgreen)
![Kafka](https://img.shields.io/badge/Apache-Kafka-black)
![Elasticsearch](https://img.shields.io/badge/Elasticsearch-8-blue)
![Docker](https://img.shields.io/badge/Docker-Compose-blue)
![Architecture](https://img.shields.io/badge/Architecture-Clean%20Architecture-purple)

An event-driven banking transaction processing platform built with **Java 21**, **Spring Boot**, **Apache Kafka**, **Elasticsearch**, and **Clean Architecture**.

The project demonstrates how a modern backend system can accept banking transactions through a REST API, publish them asynchronously to Kafka, process and enrich them through application use cases, index them in Elasticsearch, and expose searchable transaction data through an API.

---

## 🚀 Features

* Event-driven transaction processing with Apache Kafka
* Clean Architecture with clear dependency boundaries
* REST API for transaction ingestion and search
* Asynchronous transaction processing
* Customer enrichment during transaction processing
* Elasticsearch indexing and customer-based search
* Exponential retry for failed Kafka messages
* Dead Letter Queue (DLQ) for unrecoverable events
* Global API exception handling
* Request validation
* Swagger / OpenAPI documentation
* Local and development Spring profiles
* Docker Compose infrastructure
* Multi-module Maven architecture
* Framework-independent Domain and Application layers

---

## 🧱 Architecture

```text
                        ┌──────────────────┐
                        │      Client      │
                        └────────┬─────────┘
                                 │
                                 │ REST
                                 ▼
                        ┌──────────────────┐
                        │   Banking API    │
                        │  POST / GET API  │
                        └────────┬─────────┘
                                 │
                                 ▼
                        ┌──────────────────┐
                        │ Application Layer│
                        │    Use Cases     │
                        └───────┬──────────┘
                                │
                    ┌───────────┴───────────┐
                    │                       │
                    ▼                       ▼
             ┌─────────────┐         ┌───────────────┐
             │    Kafka    │         │ Domain Model  │
             │   Producer  │         │ & Rules       │
             └──────┬──────┘         └───────────────┘
                    │
                    ▼
       banking.transaction.events
                    │
                    ▼
             ┌─────────────┐
             │    Kafka    │
             │   Consumer  │
             └──────┬──────┘
                    │
                    ▼
          Process Transaction
                    │
             ┌──────┴──────┐
             │             │
             ▼             ▼
      Customer Lookup   Transaction
       / Enrichment      Repository
             │
             └──────┬──────┘
                    ▼
             ┌─────────────┐
             │Elasticsearch│
             └──────┬──────┘
                    │
                    ▼
             Transaction Search
```

### Failure Flow

```text
Kafka Event
    │
    ▼
Consumer
    │
    ├── Success ──► Process Transaction
    │
    └── Failure
          │
          ▼
    Exponential Retry
          │
          ▼
    Retry Exhausted
          │
          ▼
banking.transaction.dlq
```

